WEBVTT

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:32.375
(Laughter)

00:05:32.399 --> 00:05:35.304
So, we must admit

00:05:35.328 --> 00:05:39.232
that some of the blame falls squarely
at the feet of the users.

00:05:40.573 --> 00:05:42.976
But why is the technical overload crisis,

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.580
the complexity crisis, accelerating now?

00:05:45.604 --> 00:05:48.383
In the hardware world, it's because
we the consumers want

00:05:48.407 --> 00:05:50.591
everything to be smaller,
smaller, smaller.

00:05:50.615 --> 00:05:53.178
So the gadgets are getting
tinier and tinier,

00:05:53.202 --> 00:05:55.805
but our fingers are essentially
staying the same size.

00:05:55.829 --> 00:05:57.976
So it gets to be more and more
of a challenge.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.096
Software is subject
to another primal force: